    <p><strong><?= htmlspecialchars($site_settings['site_name'] ?? 'EduGov News') ?></strong> is a dedicated, automated digital education news and notification platform. Our mission is to provide students, candidates, and job seekers across India with rapid, 100% verified, and fact-grounded updates from official government recruitment bodies, national examination boards, and premier academic institutions.</p>

    <h2>Our Core Editorial Principles</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Zero Hallucination Policy</strong>: We never invent or extrapolate dates, vacancy numbers, eligibility criteria, or fee structures. If an official notification has not explicitly declared a date, we transparently state that it has not been specified.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct Source Transparency</strong>: Every article includes direct, verifiable links to the official government portal (.gov.in / .nic.in / .ac.in) and official PDF notices.</li>
        <li><strong>Automated Real-Time Ingestion</strong>: Our high-performance automated ingestion engine checks official portals every 15 minutes to bring you breaking announcements without delay.</li>
    </ul>

